{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misofoundations\/swift\/dictionary\/subscript(orkey:)"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no value for the given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":", returns the description of this key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"i.e.font family name without the font weight in the end and without whitespaces."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Foundations"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Subscript","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostScriptFontNamesMapKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"title":"subscript(orKey:)","extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"text":"subscript","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"orKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" _: ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"externalID":"s:SD15MISOFoundationsAA25PostScriptFontNamesMapKeyVRszSSRs_rlE02orG0SSAC_tcip","symbolKind":"subscript","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations","doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/Swift","doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(orKey:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swif